# Result Notification

Require a terminal Run summary and safe Jira/evidence reference.

1. Select DM or room from the pre-authorized Run context; never infer a recipient.
2. Render a bounded user-safe summary.
3. Send with the Run idempotency key.
4. Return delivery ID, accepted time and status.
5. On failure, keep the Run, Jira result and evidence and return retryability.

Do not send credentials, internal endpoints, raw board identifiers or unmasked logs.
